                timingType: "Chain (EA888 Gen 3B timing chain system. Highly durable compared to previous generations, though chain stretch should still be monitored past 150,000 km via VCDS)", injectionType: "Dual Injection (MPI + FSI - Features both high-pressure direct and low-pressure port injection, significantly reducing intake valve carbon buildup)", engineLifespan: "300,000+ km (The DLVB block is incredibly reliable, utilizing B-Cycle combustion. Lifespan is mainly impacted by the fragile plastic water pump module and 12V MHEV system complexity)", turboType: "IHI IS20 (Highly efficient, water-cooled turbocharger. Comically restricted by factory software to meet the 150hp 35 TFSI tier)", ecuType: "Bosch Simos 18.1 (Sophisticated management system seamlessly controlling B-Cycle valve timing, dual injection, and MHEV alternator-starter)", euroStandard: "Euro 6d-TEMP", maxPowerStockInternals: "350+ hp (Because this is mechanically identical to the 190/204hp variants, the bottom end is completely over-engineered for 150hp)",
