    drivingExperience: "The 204hp DXPA in the B10 chassis represents the peak of 4-cylinder diesel refinement. The integration of the 48V MHEV Plus Powertrain Generator provides a massive electrical torque fill at low RPMs, making the diesel feel incredibly punchy and responsive. Start-stop events are completely imperceptible. It devours highway miles with astonishing efficiency while delivering a robust 400 Nm of torque for effortless overtaking.",
    mechanicVerdict: "The DXPA EA288 Evo is mechanically phenomenal, utilizing a lighter aluminum block and a robust wet-belt oil pump. However, it trades mechanical flaws for staggering electrical and emissions complexity. The 48V MHEV Plus system, Twin-Dosing AdBlue, and variable water pump are all potential ticking time bombs that require highly specialized diagnostics. When it works, it is brilliant. When it breaks, it will be very expensive.",
